# 124_x509: X.509 parsing, signature verification, chain validation and hostname matching.
# Certificates were generated with Python `cryptography` (RSA-2048, P-256/P-384, Ed25519,
# PKCS#1 v1.5 + PSS) and cross-checked with `openssl verify`. Evaluation time is fixed at
# 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z so the tests do not depend on the clock.
